        echo "  47. CARGO_TARGET_DIR checked to be <home>/.cache/emend-build/m6p1-close/target; the other-path control offers M5 part 6's; change 20's block heading cites specs/0038 \"Close-out push (after P3)\""
        echo "  48. the scan's archive check: the range holds no archive (M6 part 1 commits none), the fixture still the signature control"
        echo "changes against M6 part 1's script (M6 part 2's close-out; the header above lists them in full):"
